  "description": "Fighters of Record of Ragnarok for Teamfight Manager 2: Lu Bu, Thor, Zeus, Adam, Poseidon, Sasaki Kojiro, Heracles, Jack the Ripper, Raiden Tameemon, Shiva, Buddha, Zerofuku, Hades, Qin Shi Huang. Kits are our own designs after the manga's fights: Lu Bu's Shield Breaker counts his blows double against shields and shatters them for real (the pack's own code, ragnarok.dll); Thor's Mjolnir flies out and back to his hand and awakens on every third skill; Zeus swells into his muscle body once he warms up and presses it down into Adamas for his ultimate; Adam reads every move with God Reader, dodges it and hits back with a copy, down to the Fist That Transcends Time; Poseidon needs no one - alone he hits harder and takes less (the pack's own code), and his trident floods a target for forty days and nights; Sasaki Kojiro, the greatest loser in history, learns every foe he strikes and hits them harder each time (the pack's own code), turns his blade back with Swallow Return and draws two swords for Niten Ganryu; Heracles, the god of justice who fights for humanity, spreads the brand of his Twelve Labors with every skill (the pack's own code) and makes his pact with Cerberus for his ultimate; Jack the Ripper sees the colour of every heart and strikes the frightened harder (the pack's own code), slips into the London fog under an umbrella his gloves made divine and throws a knife that Dear God made a divine weapon; Raiden Tameemon, the strongest sumo wrestler, unbinds the muscles he held back all his life before his first Yatagarasu, slaps with Tsuppari and stamps the ground with Shiko; Shiva dances with four arms to a rhythm that speeds him up (the pack's own code) and sets his heart alight for Tandava Karma; Buddha, the god who turned his back on the gods, sees every blow coming with Future Sight, turns his Six Realms Staff into a spear and the Kannon Shield and cuts with the Great Nirvana Sword Zero; Zerofuku, the god of misfortune, marks his foes with misfortune and swings a Misery Cleaver that grows on it, until Hajun devours him from within and breaks out of a dark cocoon for the rest of his life, with arm blades and a demon drill; Hades, king of the underworld and eldest of the three brothers, sweeps the wind of Persephone Rhoai with his bident, smashes the ground and forges the Ichor Desmos with his own blood for one thrust; Qin Shi Huang, the first emperor, sees the stars in his foes, catches their force with the Chiyou Armor Sleeves and turns it back, shielding his allies, until he draws the Goujian sword. Sharper frames from ragnarok.dll itself, with or without the League of Legends Heroes and Teamfight Tactics Heroes packs. Pixel art, effects, icons and sound effects made for this pack; Japanese voice lines from the official promotional recordings. Non-commercial fan project; Record of Ragnarok (c) its creators and publishers.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-22",
  "mod_id": "ragnarok",
